# Leyline of Sanctity: "If this card is in your opening hand, you may begin the game with it on the battlefield" (CR 103.6a):
# Bot1 accepts. "You have hexproof" (CR 702.11c): on turn 2 Bot2 has the red mana for Lightning Bolt but can't target Bot1
# (the refusal); it can still Bolt Bot1's Ornithopter (hexproof covers only the player).
# The control where the Bolt does reach Bot1: leyline-of-sanctity-declined-in-the-opening-hand-gives-no-hexproof.

[Bot1 Deck]
Leyline of Sanctity
Ornithopter
Island x5
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
! Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T2 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Leyline of Sanctity.Tapped = false
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
